OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786088871
OL,3,CVan driver pleads guilty to death of
OL,4,Chighways worker by dangerous driving
OL,6,FA van driver is facing jail for
OL,7,Fcausing the death by dangerous driving
OL,8,Fof a highways worker on the M23 near
OL,9,FCrawley.
OL,11,FVilius Domarkas, 38, pleaded guilty to
OL,12,Fcausing the death of Anthony Howe on
OL,13,FWednesday 8 July by driving a Citroen
OL,14,FRelay dangerously on the southbound
OL,15,Fcarriageway of the motorway.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
