CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786088871
OL,3,CVan driver pleads guilty to death of
OL,4,Chighways worker by dangerous driving
OL,6,FSussex Police previously said
OL,7,Femergency services were called before
OL,8,F1am on Wednesday 8 July to a collision
OL,9,Fbetween a van and a highways worker on
OL,10,Fthe M23 at Junction 9 southbound
OL,11,Fcarriageway.
OL,13,FMr Howe, a 65-year-old man from Kent,
OL,14,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FDomarkas, of no fixed address, entered
OL,17,Fhis guilty plea at Hove Crown Court on
OL,18,FThursday, as family members attended
OL,19,Fremotely and in the public gallery.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786088871
OL,3,CVan driver pleads guilty to death of
OL,4,Chighways worker by dangerous driving
OL,6,FFollowing the conviction, Sussex
OL,7,FPolice said Domarkas was found with
OL,8,Fglazed and bloodshot eyes, slurring
OL,9,Fhis speech and unsteady on his feet
OL,10,Fafter the incident, and fell over.
OL,12,FA blood sample test he provided four
OL,13,Fhours after the crash showed he was
OL,14,Fover the legal limit for alcohol, with
OL,15,F221 microgrammes (ug) per 100
OL,16,Fmililitres (ml) of blood, the force
OL,17,Fadded.
OL,19,FThe legal limit is 80ug of alcohol per
OL,20,F100ml of blood.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
