OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786088871
OL,3,CVan driver pleads guilty to death of
OL,4,Chighways worker by dangerous driving
OL,6,FHe had struck the highways worker, who
OL,7,Fwas in a coned-off area of the slip
OL,8,Froad, when he veered into the coned-
OL,9,Foff lane, police said.
OL,11,FSussex Police Detective Constable
OL,12,FKelly Newton said: "This is another
OL,13,Ftragic example of drink-driving which
OL,14,Fhas had devastating consequences.
OL,16,F"Domarkas was in no fit state to drive
OL,17,Fthat night, and his own vehicle's
OL,18,Fdashcam footage showed him driving
OL,19,Ferratically prior to the fatal
OL,20,Fcollision.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
