OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786088871
OL,3,CVan driver pleads guilty to death of
OL,4,Chighways worker by dangerous driving
OL,6,F"He has caused the death of a highways
OL,7,Fworker and put the lives of all other
OL,8,Froad users at risk when he got behind
OL,9,Fthe wheel."
OL,11,FHe will be sentenced on Monday 28
OL,12,FSeptember.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/5
